    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“Everything connects. Including you.”</em></p><p><strong>Archetype (Bad Eden): The World (Integrator).</strong> You see systems as wholes. Supply, ritual, morale, politics, travel, violence, myth — to you, these are not separate tracks, but one machine with many faces.</p><h3>Archetype Effects</h3><ul><li><strong>Faction Edge.</strong> Your archetype strengthens cross-system alignment and broad operational cohesion. This Archetype is associated with <strong>+1 Economy</strong> and <strong>+1 Diplomacy</strong> in faction calculus.</li><li><strong>Tier Engine.</strong> See this Archetype’s Tier feats (Tier 1–4) for your full tactical and strategic toolkit.</li></ul>",
